    "blogPage.post4.title": "AI Funding in Germany: The Grants and Subsidies Worth Knowing About",
    "blogPage.post4.excerpt": "Building an AI pilot doesn't have to come entirely out of your own budget. An overview of the German and EU funding programs SMBs actually use to offset the cost of a first AI project.",
    "blogPage.post5.title": "AI in the Trades: Where Handwerk Businesses See the Fastest Wins",
    "blogPage.post5.excerpt": "Handwerksbetriebe don't need a data science team to benefit from AI. A look at where trades businesses — from electricians to carpenters — are actually seeing time and money saved today.",
